    {
      "id": "37992871642d-q21",
      "number": 21,
      "question": "Which group does not match the pattern??",
      "questionHtml": "Which group does not match the pattern??",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "12, 19, 31",
          "html": "12, 19, 31"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "16, 24, 40",
          "html": "16, 24, 40"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "21, 35, 56",
          "html": "21, 35, 56"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "10, 20, 40",
          "html": "10, 20, 40"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">For each group, we check if the <strong>sum of the first number and the second number equals the third number</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>Option 1) 12, 19, 31&nbsp;&rarr; 12 + 19&nbsp;= 31&nbsp;(Matches the pattern)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1)</span>&nbsp;16, 24, 40 &rarr; 16 + 24 = 40&nbsp;(Matches the pattern)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1)</span>&nbsp;21, 35, 56 &rarr; 21 + 35 = 56&nbsp;(Matches the pattern)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1)</span>&nbsp;10, 20, 40 &rarr; 10 + 20 = 30&nbsp;(<strong>Does not match</strong>, as the third number is 40)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Whereas,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">In Option 4, the sum of 10 and 20 is 30, but the given third number is 40.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, 10, 20, 40 is odd from the given options.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;Option 4&quot;</span>.</p>\n",
